{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "86dcf847-e45d-8d34-9e34-b76de661afd1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T11:52:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sean Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:48:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:48:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi. Um, I'm calling about a flooded street. The low spot at the end of my block is under about a foot of water. A foot. And it's still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, and this is from the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. It's Monday now and the water hasn't gone down at all. [pause] Sorry, I'm on speakerphone, I'm walking around the house trying to see it from the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I can hear you okay. Is the water in the roadway, or is it up on someone's property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:42-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The roadway, the whole dip. And the sidewalk next to it is a sheet of mud and grit. Like, silt everywhere. You can't walk it. I'm worried it's going to creep up into the yards, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you see a storm drain down in that low spot? Maybe a grate at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a grate, yeah, but it's buried. Leaves and sand and, I don't know, [line breaks up] packed on top of it. I can't tell if it's even draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up there. You said the grate is buried in leaves and sand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:24-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Buried. Totally covered. And I'm a homeowner, so, you know, if that water gets toward the foundation I'm looking at real money. We're actually skipping a vacation this year to build up savings, so I really can't take a repair bill right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Let me get this into a work order so a crew can look at the drain. What's the address, or the nearest cross street to the low spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I'd rather not say the exact address on the phone, if that's okay. Can I just describe it? It's the very bottom of the block, where the road dips, right before it meets the main road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I really do need a location to send anyone. Is there a way you can give me the street name only, without the house number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. [pause] Honestly I'm not sure how to do that. Can you take my number and have somebody call me, and I'll tell them then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we can do that. What's the best callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0170."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0170. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sean Dolan. D-O-L-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Sean. I'll note a flooded low spot, clogged grate, mud on the sidewalk, and that you'll give the location when someone calls back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, yes. Thank you. Can I ask, do the crews work on weekends? Because if it's going to sit till next Monday, that's, that's a lot of days of water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a storm like this they're stretched thin and working through a long list, and some of that can run into the weekend. Your report goes in today, and I'll flag that it's standing water about a foot deep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:52:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That helps. I just don't want it forgotten."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:52:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It won't be. Someone should call you back this afternoon or tomorrow morning. And if the water starts moving toward a building, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:52:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:52:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Sean. Take care."
    }
  ],
